---
title: Marketing Platform Migration
summary: Transitioned 400+ legacy sites to a modern framework, achieving significant performance gains and enhanced maintainability.
order: 2
stack: Next.js, SEO, analytics, CI/CD
hero: '![Placeholder](../../src/assets/placeholder-2.jpg)'
